{"kind":"sentence","lang":"zh-hans","entities":{"10806994":{"renderings":[{"id":"a8c3ebdaba29c6f8","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13949337"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"「妈，冰箱裡的『酱油渍菇』看起来很好吃欸。可以吃吗？」「吃是可以，但吃了好像会肚子痛，要小心喔。」「啊？谁做的啊？」「啊，那个是阿公去山上采的野菇，阿嬷拿去醃的啦。」「那裡面该不会混进了不能吃的毒菇吧？」「是这样吗？」","derivedFrom":{"value":"「媽，冰箱裡的『醬油漬菇』看起來很好吃欸。可以吃嗎？」「吃是可以，但吃了好像會肚子痛，要小心喔。」「啊？誰做的啊？」「啊，那個是阿公去山上採的野菇，阿嬤拿去醃的啦。」「那裡面該不會混進了不能吃的毒菇吧？」「是這樣嗎？」","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"11609777":{"renderings":[{"id":"1de838f9d341a584","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13972583"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"这个，我要放进冰箱里。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"11700161":{"renderings":[{"id":"807490df89e3a4d7","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13888248"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"冰箱裡有几颗蛋，来做欧姆蛋吧。","derivedFrom":{"value":"冰箱裡有幾顆蛋，來做歐姆蛋吧。","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"12662542":{"renderings":[{"id":"48c077dc6035d3d8","lang":"zh","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"12686326"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"冰箱里什么也没有了。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"12683891":{"renderings":[{"id":"177ce394db439682","lang":"zh","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"12685944"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"冰箱里只有牛奶哦。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}